# smalltv-mod .env.example
#
# Copy to .env in this same directory and fill in your home WiFi. Used only
# by scripts/join_wifi.sh -- never baked into firmware.bin, never committed
# (.env is gitignored). This lets you skip manually typing your WiFi
# password into the device's captive-portal web UI after every UART
# flash/erase cycle.
#
# Your computer still has to join the device's own setup AP first --
# scripts/join_wifi.sh only automates the form-submit step once you're on
# it, not the WiFi-network-switching itself (unreliable to automate, and
# this project already documents macOS auto-switching away from a
# no-internet network mid-step).

# The device's default setup AP, open network, no password: "SmallTV-Setup"
# (src/config.h's DEFAULT_AP_SSID). Join that with your computer, THEN run
# scripts/join_wifi.sh.

# The home WiFi network you want the device to join.
WIFI_SSID=

# Leave blank for an open home network.
WIFI_PASS=
